activation	Print prompt	2026-10-21T17:45:00.7615220Z    `add_comment` call, or `noop` when no action is needed. If you finish without calling
activation	Print prompt	2026-10-21T17:45:00.7616198Z    any of them, the run counts as a failure, so call `noop` with a reason when in doubt.
activation	Print prompt	2026-10-21T17:45:00.7618811Z 4. Closing, locking, assigning, editing and deleting issues are not available to you.
